WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.295 --> 00:00:01.711
- Ladies and gentlemen give it up

00:00:01.711 --> 00:00:04.064
for the host of today's show

00:00:04.064 --> 00:00:04.897
Jay Leno

00:00:06.410 --> 00:00:09.030
(upbeat music)

00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:11.280
(cheering)

00:00:12.316 --> 00:00:17.316
- Thank you very much.

00:00:19.741 --> 00:00:21.890
Thank you, that's very kind.

00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:23.557
Thank you very much.

00:00:25.487 --> 00:00:26.845
Oh thank you, thank you,

00:00:26.845 --> 00:00:28.287
thank you.

00:00:28.287 --> 00:00:30.622
(cheering)

00:00:30.622 --> 00:00:32.260
I can see your disappointment.

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:35.010
You cover it well, but
thank you, thank you.

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:36.960
Well, let me explain Kelly's
taking a personal day.

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:39.060
You know, she's a mom and
we get into the holidays.

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:41.020
When you have kids, you guys
all know how that works.

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:43.360
So she asked grandpa Jay to come in

00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:45.270
and kind of fill in a little bit.

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:48.550
Now, some of you might know
Kelly and I have a history,

00:00:48.550 --> 00:00:50.083
not that kind of history.

00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:51.830
(laughing)

00:00:51.830 --> 00:00:53.590
Mine was the first talk show she ever did,

00:00:53.590 --> 00:00:55.100
when she got this show,
she called me and said,

00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:56.330
what advice do you have?

00:00:56.330 --> 00:00:58.140
So I kind of passed on some of the advice

00:00:58.140 --> 00:00:59.400
that Johnny Carson gave me.

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:01.193
And it served us both very well.

